cument_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"conditions. Liquid assets (SGS + MAS Bills + Cash) must constitute a minimum of 25% of NAV under"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","640.1615600585938","507.19732666015625","653.214599609375"],"id":"chunk_b10ee979eee982d9","normalized_text_sha256":"d90ec986dbfa9a5740c922f720988f18d0d8ce4cdd320dff9c417dec3de353b8","page":2,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"normal conditions and 35% under stress (defined as redemptions exceeding 15% of NAV in any rolling"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","655.1615600585938","507.1783752441406","668.214599609375"],"id":"chunk_f65e6c7e8013a25f","normalized_text_sha256":"af742e56d9f774a77b346c6f5ad2dc120d60986e35691def4068fa73a96a138c","page":2,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"5-day period). Liquidity stress testing shall be conducted monthly using MAS-prescribed scenarios and"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","670.1615600585938","278.5511169433594","683.214599609375"],"id":"chunk_65962fb253e9ce8a","normalized_text_sha256":"c8fc6d6af8bf6e7fbdce91936bdff558206b349cc62f179fa09d1c2dca57959f","page":2,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"reported to the Board Risk Committee quarterly."},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","698.8941040039062","255.7861328125","718.1720581054688"],"id":"chunk_111dd4b24b25dafe","normalized_text_sha256":"63097028779274d88684192b9ffbf4313e4a3cf206741c79621ae294db259575","page":2,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"4. Reporting Requirements"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","727.1614990234375","514.5787963867188","740.2145385742188"],"id":"chunk_30e555d0652e3459","normalized_text_sha256":"048a5a466c1982069a1c9aa930a14dc0ba7bd76150633dc1cda11347efd97324","page":2,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"All reports must be generated and distributed within the timelines specified below. Data sources must be"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","742.1614990234375","510.3608703613281","755.2145385742188"],"id":"chunk_c26563f729252082","normalized_text_sha256":"fac8c53e01b6964a3ae54563f2272b2e8ee30da4f603f883f64c3eb650657135","page":2,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"clearly referenced, and any manual adjustments to system-generated figures must be documented with"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","76.15364837646484","326.858642578125","89.20664978027344"],"id":"chunk_c2b39f0336993325","normalized_text_sha256":"e5de901ee9d03152cd9794b6f774f1a523069c9addc941bde26bae364322149b","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"the approving officer's signature and reason for adjustment."},{"bbox":["82.9527587890625","101.30615234375","502.5179443359375","112.32215118408203"],"id":"chunk_abe86cc05839203e","normalized_text_sha256":"aeb82e1fdcf480f5b986569ddab4661b78012a0d2acd0174bb57f4263eea138b","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Report Name Frequency Recipients Key Data Points Retention"},{"bbox":["82.9527587890625","121.26615142822266","510.534912109375","132.25814819335938"],"id":"chunk_88f5b7b916076a1d","normalized_text_sha256":"5f20260d963b812218905ddafe116e821f84f6ee110a46305e965d3a93683f99","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Daily NAV Report Daily T+1 PM, Risk, Fund Admin NAV per unit, total AUM, daily P&L, duration, DV01 7 years"},{"bbox":["82.9527587890625","141.26614379882812","496.71893310546875","152.25814819335938"],"id":"chunk_98089bcc69fb44aa","normalized_text_sha256":"3bd91e03da048489ec28398835540a247ac656fb2c9f8d7058e618716a3a20ba","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Portfolio Holdings Report Daily T+1 PM, Compliance Full position list, market values, weight vs limits 7 years"},{"bbox":["82.9527587890625","161.26614379882812","528.3029174804688","172.25814819335938"],"id":"chunk_b74b278b71095e5e","normalized_text_sha256":"b8807e63607c736a84e65fe9b6b0026d1db0cd826d3cff57b796731fcafe4d02","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Risk Dashboard Daily T+1 CRO, PM, Risk Team VaR, ES, duration, concentration metrics, limit utilisation 7 years"},{"bbox":["82.9527587890625","181.26614379882812","521.1749267578125","192.25814819335938"],"id":"chunk_4e7ddec5a5c4c065","normalized_text_sha256":"9b9a0c2edef4caf6fde15c6a9b012f10ef073e4d527c5b7305f0a2f5a868642a","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Monthly Performance ReportMonthly T+5 Board, Investors Return vs benchmark, risk metrics, attribution analysis 10 years"},{"bbox":["82.9527587890625","201.26614379882812","496.3099365234375","212.25814819335938"],"id":"chunk_7b1e5183d5c6124e","normalized_text_sha256":"2aa2619117e1e45a3a2fa1eb27bd46d0b650a30e0f82091052c9fd44bf683b00","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Quarterly Investor Letter Quarterly T+15 All investors Market commentary, fund positioning, outlook 10 years"},{"bbox":["82.9527587890625","221.26614379882812","531.430908203125","232.25814819335938"],"id":"chunk_e1088bda65c5edf1","normalized_text_sha256":"baf657d600acf5dc1d0bbbbfc8677aa8531ff50065b7eb55a043979045f201b1","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Annual Compliance Report Annual MAS, Board Regulatory compliance, policy adherence, exceptions log Permanent"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","259.3900451660156","322.692138671875","278.6680603027344"],"id":"chunk_2b045727e772e0b8","normalized_text_sha256":"515a475d2f96bed1f869cf1a30d87b9c928f7c4a1705c9604d356d4ee3b70159","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"5. Compliance & Audit Requirements"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","287.6575622558594","509.80987548828125","300.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_afce1227e9893cad","normalized_text_sha256":"635a1f77ea2a6af8819d3ca28cdcf0433d3d83ceb258a87c37bf3cc6f74eb8d7","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"The Fund operates under MAS Notice SFA 04-N14 and the MAS Technology Risk Management (TRM)"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","302.6575622558594","503.48284912109375","315.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_80cc719ad5b23f70","normalized_text_sha256":"30b5b723269dfe043db245319995292150c1042b03d1d62a74b9d99dbd1b913f","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Guidelines. All technology systems used in portfolio management, risk calculation, and reporting must"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","317.6575622558594","496.07281494140625","330.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_86f4053592c2bcef","normalized_text_sha256":"d5b41b098caa5601567eae387dea8698070774787bb18cfcb5c39060dd9e77b2","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"comply with TRM requirements including data integrity controls, access management, and audit trail"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","332.6575622558594","133.8946533203125","345.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_6d428de17f1a1007","normalized_text_sha256":"19f10313145e6c52dd33d32cd67acf3bab92dd31c1db3337f27af02f4848882c","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"maintenance."},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","357.6000671386719","226.01510620117188","372.7470703125"],"id":"chunk_7939c3ee0593f89b","normalized_text_sha256":"7eaf1575cb134cfae76db154b827ea245a657eddb15889341f997369a8be6ebd","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"5.1 Audit Trail Requirements"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","379.6575622558594","516.6878662109375","392.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_6a0b6e2343e330c8","normalized_text_sha256":"ff9c0d2246701c50b8c4386f776ad1589f5c2cace560070da249838cef503825","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"All data used in regulatory and investor reporting must maintain a complete audit trail from source to final"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","394.6575622558594","158.7086639404297","407.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_85e5fdf5745dec27","normalized_text_sha256":"5a2dc71619e06d93d831148d29f222013cdee504bbbf922434ad646f5cf2468e","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"output. Specifically:"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","415.6575622558594","496.8043518066406","428.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_db42a6268ec713ac","normalized_text_sha256":"fd4feacfdc277d854924e8db46deb7736afee09b662033fe47faab293b92570a","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"• Source data provenance: Every data point in a report must be traceable to its originating system or"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","430.6575622558594","264.8331298828125","443.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_5637da9546787d51","normalized_text_sha256":"faa541ccae29efbe5077bfd9249a2e8381bc4a54b0b113df23b3874fcaeaa583","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"document, including timestamp of extraction."},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","451.6575622558594","513.1633911132812","464.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_a204bc5866b6bb6d","normalized_text_sha256":"9c1d91dd81de5a96515e8753a6d2ec2b2ab6d26348c3c83535dda3159875e8ca","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"• Transformation log: Any calculation, adjustment, or derivation applied to source data must be recorded"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","466.6575622558594","447.0148010253906","479.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_03dd44767bdcae2f","normalized_text_sha256":"aea122de1f911804baf166dde81d01c787569ae40055073d8b12947b6ff495e4","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"with the formula/methodology used and the identity of the responsible person or system."},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","487.6575622558594","496.74737548828125","500.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_79513817035a7316","normalized_text_sha256":"2d44392e0ef2a6adfe3e39cf17403239290ff7814349d77f2d833ee0a3899b58","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"• Version control: All reports must carry a version number. Amendments to previously issued reports"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","502.6575622558594","282.7881164550781","515.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_e9c4bbcdcb5bf7ec","normalized_text_sha256":"770539595786619acf0dfec1c2a8074a635df3b6eacd972d37fc6b29d3a8c84b","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"require documented justification and re-approval."},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","523.6575317382812","475.1158447265625","536.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_8902bc1b2252719b","normalized_text_sha256":"67f87f9a27e67a2d38024b0839f5b4e3b78c62f67b2d9683237c83503bf89a05","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"• Immutability: Audit records must be stored in a write-once, append-only format. Retrospective"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","538.6575317382812","252.1601104736328","551.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_9a3af878a79de4fe","normalized_text_sha256":"f0cbe459e56b31657e16e5ccfce70db651762c91ce20cc1a8cea3ea0a732b650","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"modification of audit records is prohibited."},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","559.6575317382812","508.9358825683594","572.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_06966fbfc91ff06c","normalized_text_sha256":"fa79b034e7333e86c5ea45893704644a749937a9e826478a73d17d33ae02432d","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"• Retention: Audit trails must be retained for a minimum of 7 years for transaction data and 10 years for"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","574.6575317382812","173.4811553955078","587.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_645ab8915d72d515","normalized_text_sha256":"ab6b2408a35da72dcedc6d4e9c35abd30415a1d41dcd06096c945f772e827999","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"investor-facing reports."},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","599.6000366210938","254.13111877441406","614.7470703125"],"id":"chunk_0abe90f964b68f13","normalized_text_sha256":"e1a946339c1fa835d65880178f125ad4df9c3d797cf232d795b2fca1e207b248","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"5.2 Exception & Breach Reporting"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","621.6575317382812","479.229248046875","634.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_6d94f432b46cb8d5","normalized_text_sha256":"93283641068e89d9e92299692cab0c729d56f4737f8f5572ce0a93c8a8bd6c76","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Any breach of the investment guidelines set out in this document must be reported to the Risk &"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","636.6575317382812","510.8834228515625","649.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_f03fdc1df19aa0f9","normalized_text_sha256":"1faab31238b0593b8cae84f5b69e1f38a8887eb7f522aab3812fbf94d5f3ee99","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Compliance Committee within 24 hours of detection. The report must include: (a) nature and magnitude"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","651.6575317382812","518.2744140625","664.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_810ebc2dcbaa18e2","normalized_text_sha256":"8ff05df27f155fbdf433d0dc23e9cdebddea0de9da03ac3412d9de3465a1808e","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"of breach, (b) affected positions, (c) root cause analysis, (d) proposed remediation plan with timeline, and"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","666.6575317382812","500.8133239746094","679.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_f489fef4fb54edcf","normalized_text_sha256":"6640b080d0dd46f69de7cf4d64d4af4005bfab41e8f1b8c45cc15232d8d71817","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"(e) interim risk mitigation measures. Material breaches (defined as exceeding 110% of any hard limit)"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","681.6575317382812","302.85211181640625","694.7105712890625"],"id":"chunk_59def6ba5b1a7b0d","normalized_text_sha256":"ded2a0ab3a50c8aa0c57e17c51509601641ff20eaaf8a0d0bc55c30300a0173f","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"must also be reported to MAS within 3 business days."},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","710.3900756835938","311.8001403808594","729.6680297851562"],"id":"chunk_d394c56d94aedeae","normalized_text_sha256":"0b85f2831031d7072d39e920a834fa6788e94e9ee9a40712754d4330da546cc6","page":3,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"6. Document Amendment & Review"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","76.15364837646484","476.02777099609375","89.20664978027344"],"id":"chunk_d5970f1023960ada","normalized_text_sha256":"bfc2c362a8c6c14fb8fb92f192f36fd00d1fac653e630c03991a291f82514a6b","page":4,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"This document is reviewed annually by the Investment Management Committee and the Risk &"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","91.15364837646484","501.8772888183594","104.20664978027344"],"id":"chunk_9a7a4488f8662c5b","normalized_text_sha256":"06c8047a8364ba2c2d0090fb8711701903380b2f7a99a72d829b085b94898888","page":4,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Compliance Committee. Ad-hoc amendments may be initiated by the CIO or CRO and require written"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","106.15364837646484","489.78387451171875","119.20664978027344"],"id":"chunk_ba8c057fec5c431f","normalized_text_sha256":"005665021c851b37ae9665928cb9a4e174ec4c31b1d8ac3ce39ab5ac90594062","page":4,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"approval from both. All amendments are recorded in the Document Change Log maintained by the"},{"bbox":["76.86614227294922","121.15364837646484","165.56764221191406","134.20664978027344"],"id":"chunk_a0525403521e21db","normalized_text_sha256":"5bb902cc5691da272fdfb4cb84e8b4dc0403da6c8da74c3f05df96c1cf6c9e01","page":4,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Compliance function."},{"bbox":["83.9527587890625","147.27114868164062","392.4352722167969","158.97564697265625"],"id":"chunk_6f30eb87f7f67217","normalized_text_sha256":"38dc65248b3411b484986e98e8f4c6f926a9f75b87dd577a7ad5b2bdb8dbe0e1","page":4,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"Version Date Author Summary of Changes"},{"bbox":["83.9527587890625","169.22865295410156","421.73480224609375","180.90765380859375"],"id":"chunk_a50942fc873ac0f8","normalized_text_sha256":"99b52345e6aa14fbfb7f78c0d5e6d3da7a1a3155bb0fa0f674560f58033bc5d6","page":4,"row_number":null,"source_document_id":"doc:sample_fund_guidelines:e88d142c204e1054","text":"1.0 01 Jan 2022 J. Tan (CRO) Initial version approved by IMC"},{"bbox":["83.9527587890625","191.22865295410156","467.558349609375","202.90765380859375"],"id":"chunk_ada878e0141e1f45","normalized_text_sha256":"62f694c085c6e7